#. module: xb_taecel_network
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:xb_taecel_network.action_taecel_affiliate
msgid ""
"TAECEL has no web-service method to list your network, so each\n"
"                affiliate is recorded here once, with the ws key and NIP TAECEL\n"
"                issued to it. From then on its balance, sales and your margin\n"
"                are read automatically."
msgstr "TAECEL no tiene ningún método de web service para listar tu red, así que cada afiliado se registra aquí una vez, con la clave y el NIP de ws que TAECEL le emitió. De ahí en adelante su saldo, sus ventas y tu margen se leen solos."

